@startuml
title CV 领域用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "求职者" as User
actor "文本提取器" as Parser
actor "AI Provider\n（可选，默认禁用）" as AI
actor "Job 域" as Job

rectangle "CV 领域" {
  usecase "UC-CV-001\n上传并提取 CV" as UC1
  usecase "UC-CV-002\n确认或修正提取文本" as UC2
  usecase "UC-CV-003\n通用 CV 健康评审" as UC3
  usecase "UC-CV-004\n岗位定制 CV 评审" as UC4
  usecase "UC-CV-005\n逐项决定建议" as UC5
  usecase "UC-CV-006\n生成并复制新版本" as UC6
  usecase "UC-CV-007\n管理 AI 同意与\n可追溯调用" as UC7
  usecase "UC-CV-008\n预览并手动删除\nCV 敏感对象" as UC8
  usecase "校验不得编造事实" as FactCheck
  usecase "记录 provider/model/输入/\n提示/成本/输出与缓存" as Trace
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4
User --> UC5
User --> UC6
User --> UC7
User --> UC8

Parser --> UC1
Job --> UC4
AI --> UC7

UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC7 : <<extend>>\n使用外部 AI 时
UC4 ..> UC7 : <<extend>>\n使用外部 AI 时
UC3 ..> FactCheck : <<include>>
UC4 ..> FactCheck : <<include>>
UC6 ..> FactCheck : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> Trace : <<include>>

note bottom of UC1
仅 PDF/DOCX；v1 无 OCR
end note

note bottom of UC6
仅结构化文本，可复制；
不生成最终 PDF/DOCX
end note

note bottom of UC8
级联硬删除内容；
仅保留无内容审计事件
end note
@enduml
